          },
          "status": "outside",
          "text": "Visual line of sight for the whole flight. The remote pilot in command, the person at the controls and any visual observer are able to see the aircraft throughout the flight with vision unaided by any device other than corrective lenses, and either the two pilots or a visual observer keep watching it."
